            "treatment.3",
            "treatment.4",
            "treatment.5",
            "treatment.6",
            "treatment.7",
            "treatment.8",
            "treatment.9"
          ],
          "text": "Wound cultures grew Group A Streptococcus and anaerobes. She required full multi-organ support including intubation and ventilation, noradrenaline, and CVVH for AKI. She underwent four surgical debridements (days 0, 2, 5, and 9) with washout, delayed closure, and VAC dressing. Antibiotic therapy comprised a prolonged course of IV piperacillin-tazobactam, rationalised to benzylpenicillin and clindamycin per microbiology advice. Prone positioning was performed twice for ARDS. Lines were changed for line sepsis on day 14. Nutrition was delivered via nasogastric tube with subsequent improvement in oral intake. Renal function recovered and CVVH was stopped on day 16; she was extubated on day 18 and stepped down to the ward on day 24. Wound healing is continuing by secondary intention with district nurse and tissue viability support. She has been engaged in prolonged rehabilitation and physiotherapy.",
